{
 "_sources": [
  {
   "field": "rule,stab,reg,voice",
   "name": "World Bank Worldwide Governance Indicators, 2025 revision (data year 2025; API last updated 2026-09-25)",
   "url": "https://api.worldbank.org/v2/country/all/indicator/GOV_WGI_RL.EST?source=3&format=json",
   "year": 2025,
   "note": "Indicators GOV_WGI_RL.EST, GOV_WGI_PV.EST, GOV_WGI_RQ.EST, GOV_WGI_VA.EST; legacy *.PER.RNK percentile codes no longer served"
  },
  {
   "field": "civicus",
   "name": "CIVICUS Monitor ratings, People Power Under Attack 2025 (data last updated Dec 2025)",
   "url": "https://monitor.civicus.org/",
   "year": 2025
  },
  {
   "field": "prop",
   "name": "Heritage Foundation 2026 Index of Economic Freedom, Property Rights component",
   "url": "https://static.heritage.org/index/data/2026/2026_indexofeconomicfreedom_data.xlsx",
   "year": 2026
  },
  {
   "field": "relig",
   "name": "Freedom House, Freedom in the World 2026 (covers 2025), indicator D2 (0-4) x25",
   "url": "https://freedomhouse.org/country/{slug}/freedom-world/2026",
   "year": 2026
  },
  {
   "field": "prop (estimates only)",
   "name": "Freedom House FIW 2026 indicator G2 (property & business rights), used only as a predictor for missing Heritage values",
   "url": "https://freedomhouse.org/countries/freedom-world/scores",
   "year": 2026
  }
 ],
 "_method": "WGI: the 2025 WGI revision no longer publishes percentile ranks through the API, so percentile rank was computed from the governance estimate (EST) for data year 2025 as 100*(economies ranked below + half of ties)/(N-1) across all 215 economies covered (incl. territories), reproducing the legacy WGI percentile definition (0=lowest, 100=highest). CIVICUS: current Monitor rating, lower-cased. prop: Heritage 2026 Property Rights score (0-100). For 13 places Heritage does not cover (AND, ATG, GRD, HKG, KNA, MAC, MCO, MHL, NRU, PLW, SMR, SSD, TUV) prop is an OLS estimate from WGI Rule of Law percentile and FH G2x25 (R2=0.93, n=183; MAC uses RL only, R2=0.92) and est=true. relig: Freedom House FIW 2026 indicator D2 (0-4) x25. Macau (not rated by FH or CIVICUS): relig=75 and civicus=repressed are reasoned estimates (Basic Law protections and generally respected worship, but post-2020 bans on commemorative gatherings, 2021 disqualification of pro-democracy candidates and the 2023 national-security-law expansion), est=true. est=true marks any record containing an estimated field; per-country notes are in research/gov_build_log.json.",
